{"_id":"68a736138ec3d8323af15034","nodeId":"Ad10evrGQuYRl5GaMhQwu","roadmapSlug":"data-engineer","createdAt":"2025-08-21T15:06:58.672Z","description":"# What is Cluster Computing\n\nCluster computing is a model where multiple computers are networked together to act as a unified processing system. Tasks are split across nodes in the cluster and executed in parallel. This approach is used in big data processing, scientific computing, and any workload that exceeds single-machine capacity.","resources":[{"type":"article","title":"What is cluster computing? - IBM","url":"https://www.ibm.com/think/topics/cluster-computing","_id":"6a7f4a42cb44947debcf5239"},{"type":"article","title":"Computer cluster - Wikipedia","url":"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Computer_cluster","_id":"6a7f4a42cb44947debcf523a"},{"type":"video","title":"WUnderstand the Basic Cluster Concepts","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8BBDxzJL6fY","_id":"6a7f4a42cb44947debcf523b"}],"updatedAt":"2026-08-14T17:02:58.294Z","lessonPacks":[],"paidResources":[{"_id":"6a5e04e1fb5fcb94d0417044","title":"DataCamp - Associate Data Engineer in SQL","partner":"DataCamp","type":"course","url":"https://datacamp.pxf.io/WOP6XG"},{"_id":"6a5e04e1fb5fcb94d0417100","title":"DataCamp - Data Engineer in Python","partner":"DataCamp","type":"course","url":"https://datacamp.pxf.io/JkYLbr"}],"contribution":"https://github.com/kamranahmedse/developer-roadmap/tree/master/roadmaps/data-engineer/content/Ad10evrGQuYRl5GaMhQwu.md"}